OL,3,GNEWSAZuckerberg gifts GAA clubs bB,150k
OL,4,Aafter castle purchase
OL,5,
OL,6,FMeta boss Mark Zuckerberg is taking a
OL,7,Fstep into Irish sports by giving three
OL,8,FGaelic Athletic Association (GAA) clubs
OL,9,Fin County Waterford bB,150,000
OL,10,F(#129,000).
OL,12,FThe clubs are the three closest located
OL,13,Fto Zuckerberg's newly-purchased
OL,14,FStrancally Castle.
OL,16,FZuckerberg and his wife, Priscilla
OL,17,FChan, plan to give the clubs -
OL,18,FShamrocks GAA, Tallow GAA and Lismore
OL,19,FGAA - bB,50,000 (#43,000) each, with
OL,20,Fdonations to be paid over a two-year
OL,21,Fperiod.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,415,410,260,120,0,100
