OL,3,GNEWSAZuckerberg gifts GAA clubs bB,150k
OL,4,Aafter castle purchase
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesman for Zuckerberg said the
OL,7,Fcouple were "aware of the very
OL,8,Fsignificant role that the GAA plays in
OL,9,Flocal communities in Ireland" and as
OL,10,Fnew members of the community, they
OL,11,F"wanted to support" the clubs.
